==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**26,500 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
**26,600 grants +5 Legend Rare Catseyes.
**26,700 grants +5 Special Catseyes.
*Added '''[[Abyssal Stage]]''' (アビスステージ, ''Abisu Sutēji'') mode for certain [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]]:
**Includes [[Clionel Ascendant]], [[River Styx]] and [[Queen's Coronation]].
**In the [[Legend Stages]] menu, the button for any map with this feature available will have a weathered-looking upper-left corner, seemingly decaying or crumbling to expose a portion of a darker button underneath.
**Tapping the button will show a crown difficulty selection with the Abyssal version, a "negative" crown, before 1 crown.
**In the Abyssal version, you can rechallenge the stage for additional rewards obtained over 5 clears, including Uber Rare [[Catseye]]s and Dark Catseyes. After each clear, the units you used for your lineup become unusable, similar to [[Underground Labyrinth]]. You can undo previous clears, which lowers your stage challenge count by 1 but allows you to reuse that unit in case of mistakes. You do not need a full lineup for each clear.
*Added 1 new [[Talent Orbs|Ability Orb]] type:
**'''Resists Explosions''' (爆破ダメージ耐性, ''Bakuha Damēji Taisei''): Reduces damage the unit receives from [[Explosion]]s by 5-50%. Becomes immunity with two S-Rank Resists Explosions Orbs.
*Raised [[Baozi Cat (Special Cat)|Baozi Cat]]'s and [[Firecracker Cat (Special Cat)|Firecracker Cat]]'s + level cap from +25 to +30.
*Raised [[Ancient Egg: N204 (Special Cat)|Ancient Egg: N204]]'s + level cap from +15 to +20.
*Removed [[Raclesa (Uber Rare Cat)|Raclesa]] from the [[Cat Guide]] in international versions.
*Changed the descriptions of [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed M. Titan Cat]], [[Princess Kaguya (Uber Rare Cat)|The Chaos Moon]], [[Mighty Carrowsell (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Carrowsell]], [[Those Guys]], [[Shadow Boxer K]], [[Zomboe]] and [[Gigahaniwan]].
*Fixed [[Kaijin Doge]]'s attack animation.
*Renamed [[J.K. Bun Bun|J.K Bun Bun]] to J.K. Bun Bun.
*Renamed [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Cat Capsules]] to Rare Capsules.
*Reduced the brightness of the results screen in Rare Capsules.
*Added a confirmation window to the auto-lineup feature.
**The confirmation window will only appear the first time that it is used.
**The window will not appear if the chosen lineup slot is empty or if there are no units left that can be removed.

